<title>AUSTRALIA: Hoyts sets four cent half-year dividend.</title>
<headline>Hoyts sets four cent half-year dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cinema operator Hoyts Cinemas Ltd said on Thursday it would pay a four cents a share dividend for the six month period to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Hoyts said the dividend pay date was July 25 for those shareholders registered on July 14.</p>
<p>The cinema group, which listed on the Australian Stock Exchange in August, reported a maiden half year net profit of A$12.17 million in the 1996/97 first half.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
